{"seq":2,"slug":"stock-to-go-clearance-curve","title":"stock-to-go 与清仓曲线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/markdown-decision-optimization/stock-to-go-clearance-curve","wordCount":1915,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"stock-to-go-与清仓曲线\">stock-to-go 与清仓曲线</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前一篇把降价拆成时机、深度、频次三个参数，但没回答一个隐藏的前提：**这些参数是按什么状态来决定的？**答案是一个叫 <strong>stock-to-go</strong> 的量——在剩余销售窗口内，还&quot;必须&quot;卖出去多少。它不是当前的库存余额，而是经过目标修正后的出清目标：从总库存中减去已被订单锁定、已分配给其他渠道、以及计划留作季末尾货的部分，剩下的才是真正需要在窗口内清掉的数量。</p>\n<p>stock-to-go 是清仓路径规划的状态变量。有了它，降价决策从&quot;现在库存多少&quot;升级为&quot;相对于计划的清仓进度，我现在跑在前面还是落后&quot;。这个转化的价值在于，它让降价从<strong>被动响应</strong>（卖不动了才降）变成<strong>主动跟踪</strong>（偏离计划就调整）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[期初可清库存 Q0] --&gt; B[扣除锁定/其他渠道分配]&#10;  B --&gt; C[stock-to-go 目标 S0]&#10;  C --&gt; D[按窗口切分周度出清目标]&#10;  D --&gt; E[每周: 实际销量 vs 计划]&#10;  E --&gt; F{累计偏差}&#10;  F --&gt;|落后| G[提前/加深降价]&#10;  F --&gt;|领先| H[维持或收窄降价]&#10;  F --&gt;|符合| I[维持当前档位]&#10;  G --&gt; J[更新剩余 stock-to-go]&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; E\">graph TD\n  A[期初可清库存 Q0] --&gt; B[扣除锁定/其他渠道分配]\n  B --&gt; C[stock-to-go 目标 S0]\n  C --&gt; D[按窗口切分周度出清目标]\n  D --&gt; E[每周: 实际销量 vs 计划]\n  E --&gt; F{累计偏差}\n  F --&gt;|落后| G[提前/加深降价]\n  F --&gt;|领先| H[维持或收窄降价]\n  F --&gt;|符合| I[维持当前档位]\n  G --&gt; J[更新剩余 stock-to-go]\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"stock-to-go-的定义与分解\">stock-to-go 的定义与分解</h2><h3 id=\"从库存余额到清仓目标\">从库存余额到清仓目标</h3><p>设期初可清库存为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，窗口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 周，目标是期末残余比例不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>（如 5%），则需在窗口内清掉 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0 = Q_0(1-\\epsilon)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。但直接平坦地分摊到每周是错误的——需求不是均匀的，季节品的需求前高后低，节庆品有尖峰。正确的分解是<strong>按需求分布的形状做加权分摊</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>w</mi></msub><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>W</mi></munderover><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_w = S_0 \\cdot \\frac{\\hat{f}_w}{\\sum_{u=1}^{W}\\hat{f}_u}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8058em;vertical-align:-1.1709em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6349em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1709em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{f}_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 周的相对需求形状（可由同品类历史周度形态估计）。这样得到的周度目标才是可达的——平坦分摊在需求前倾的品类上会制造&quot;第一周就落后&quot;的假象。</p>\n<h3 id=\"剩余-stock-to-go-的动态更新\">剩余 stock-to-go 的动态更新</h3><p>每周结束后，剩余目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>实际销量</mtext><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{w} = S_{w-1} - \\text{实际销量}_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际销量</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。但更稳的做法是同时更新分母——若剩余窗口缩短而库存没减少，周度目标会急剧抬升，这正是系统应该发出&quot;需要加深降价&quot;信号的时刻。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE clearance_plan_weekly (&#10;  plan_id       VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id        BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  week_index    INT         NOT NULL,   -- 相对窗口起点的周次&#10;  week_start    DATE        NOT NULL,&#10;  target_units  DECIMAL(18,3) NOT NULL, -- 该周计划出清量&#10;  actual_units  DECIMAL(18,3) DEFAULT 0,&#10;  plan_price    DECIMAL(18,4),          -- 计划执行价&#10;  realized_price DECIMAL(18,4),         -- 实际成交均价&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (plan_id, sku_id, week_index)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 当前进度偏差：落后为正，代表还需加速&#10;WITH agg AS (&#10;  SELECT sku_id,&#10;         SUM(target_units)                                   AS target_to_date,&#10;         SUM(actual_units)                                   AS actual_to_date,&#10;         SUM(target_units) - SUM(actual_units)                AS gap_units&#10;  FROM clearance_plan_weekly&#10;  WHERE plan_id = :plan AND week_start &lt;= :today&#10;  GROUP BY sku_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT sku_id, target_to_date, actual_to_date, gap_units,&#10;       (actual_to_date / NULLIF(target_to_date,0))           AS progress_ratio&#10;FROM agg&#10;ORDER BY progress_ratio ASC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> clearance_plan_weekly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plan_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  week_index    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 相对窗口起点的周次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  week_start    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target_units  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 该周计划出清量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actual_units  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plan_price    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 计划执行价</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  realized_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 实际成交均价</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (plan_id, sku_id, week_index)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 当前进度偏差：落后为正，代表还需加速</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> agg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target_units)                                   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_to_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(actual_units)                                   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual_to_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target_units) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(actual_units)                </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap_units</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clearance_plan_weekly</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plan_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :plan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> week_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :today</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id, target_to_date, actual_to_date, gap_units,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (actual_to_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target_to_date,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> progress_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> agg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> progress_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>progress_ratio</code> 低于 1 的 SKU 就是需要加深降价的对象；但它只说明&quot;落后&quot;，不说明&quot;落后多少算严重&quot;——后者要结合剩余窗口与剩余库存换算成新的 WOS 缺口，回到识别环节的紧迫度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"清仓曲线-路径而非点位\">清仓曲线：路径而非点位</h2><h3 id=\"曲线的形状由需求与折价共同决定\">曲线的形状由需求与折价共同决定</h3><p>把每个时间点的价格与对应的累计出清量画出来，就是<strong>清仓曲线</strong>。它的形状通常不是直线：起步段平缓（正价或浅折扣，出清慢），中段陡峭（折扣到位，需求释放），尾段又变平（剩下的都是最难卖的尾货，再降价也难动）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[阶段1&lt;br/&gt;正价清尾&lt;br/&gt;斜率小] --&gt; B[阶段2&lt;br/&gt;首档折扣&lt;br/&gt;斜率陡增]&#10;  B --&gt; C[阶段3&lt;br/&gt;深折冲刺&lt;br/&gt;斜率最大]&#10;  C --&gt; D[阶段4&lt;br/&gt;尾货处置&lt;br/&gt;斜率趋零]\">graph LR\n  A[阶段1&lt;br/&gt;正价清尾&lt;br/&gt;斜率小] --&gt; B[阶段2&lt;br/&gt;首档折扣&lt;br/&gt;斜率陡增]\n  B --&gt; C[阶段3&lt;br/&gt;深折冲刺&lt;br/&gt;斜率最大]\n  C --&gt; D[阶段4&lt;br/&gt;尾货处置&lt;br/&gt;斜率趋零]</pre><p>理解曲线形状的实务价值在于<strong>识别&quot;卡在哪个阶段&quot;</strong>。一个 SKU 若在阶段 2 停留过久（折扣已给但斜率没起来），通常不是价格问题而是<strong>曝光问题</strong>——读者可对照 <a href=\"../clearance-channels/outlet-zone-search-exposure\">站内 outlet 专区与搜索曝光</a>，那里讲清&quot;降价不曝光等于没降&quot;。反之，一个 SKU 在阶段 3 斜率仍然很平，说明需求已耗尽，此时继续降价是纯粹送毛利，正确的动作是转渠道。</p>\n<h3 id=\"服务水平与报童视角\">服务水平与报童视角</h3><p>清仓的&quot;要清掉多少&quot;有强烈的不确定性成分：窗口内的需求是随机变量。经典的最优服务水平框架（报童模型）在此可以直接借用，只是目标函数从&quot;最大化期望利润&quot;变成&quot;在满足清仓率约束下最大化毛利回收&quot;。若把清仓看作单周期问题，最优清仓比例对应一个分位数——即需求分布的某个百分位。这条思路在需求分布不确定时尤其有用：分布不确定时可以用分布鲁棒方法，把最坏情况纳入考虑。</p>\n<p>需求的分布尾型直接影响最优决策：对重尾需求（幂律尾），基于一阶矩的稳健决策会偏保守，需要引入更高阶矩（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1806.05379\">Das, Dhara, Natarajan, &quot;On the heavy-tail behavior of the distributionally robust newsvendor&quot;, arXiv:1806.05379</a>）。实务中对清仓的含义是：<strong>爆款尾货不应该按均值需求规划</strong>，它们的长尾特性意味着&quot;卖得完&quot;的概率被系统性低估。</p>\n<h3 id=\"需求参数不确定下的修正\">需求参数不确定下的修正</h3><p>真实系统里，需求参数本身是估计出来的，有误差。当参数不确定时，最优的降价路径会比&quot;点估计下的最优路径&quot;更保守地分散风险——这也是为什么把清仓压到最后一档是坏策略：它把所有不确定性都集中在窗口末端，一旦需求不及预期就没有回旋余地。分批出清本质上是在<strong>用时间换确定性</strong>。</p>\n<p>关于降价路径与库存分配在需求参数不确定下的联合优化，运筹文献有系统性讨论，例如零售链在需求依赖库存时的最优降价定价与库存分配（<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1287/msom.2016.0609\">Optimal Markdown Pricing and Inventory Allocation for Retail Chains with Inventory Dependent Demand, Manufacturing &amp; Service Operations Management, 2017</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"执行层面的工程约束\">执行层面的工程约束</h2><h3 id=\"价格的生效与回滚\">价格的生效与回滚</h3><p>清仓价一旦生效就会立刻影响所有渠道。因此降价计划必须是<strong>可回滚的版本化对象</strong>，而不是对商品主数据的直接改写。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;markdown_override&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;sku_id&quot;: 8830112,&#10;    &quot;plan_id&quot;: &quot;MP-2026Q4-APPAREL-001&quot;,&#10;    &quot;tier&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;price_effective_from&quot;: &quot;2026-10-05T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;price_effective_to&quot;: &quot;2026-10-19T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;rollback_to&quot;: &quot;tier_1&quot;,&#10;    &quot;max_duration_days&quot;: 21,&#10;    &quot;auto_expire&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"markdown_override\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sku_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8830112</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"plan_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MP-2026Q4-APPAREL-001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"price_effective_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-05T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"price_effective_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-19T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rollback_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tier_1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_duration_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">21</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"auto_expire\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>auto_expire: true</code> 是关键的防御：临时降价若因故障没有到期回滚，会变成永久价格。清单里必须有一条自动到期兜底，且到期后回到的是<strong>上一个明确的档位</strong>（<code>rollback_to</code>），而不是&quot;原价&quot;——因为许多清仓商品本就不再以原价销售。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与库存分配的耦合\">与库存分配的耦合</h3><p>stock-to-go 的分母假设所有可售库存都用于本渠道。若同一批货同时挂在站内 outlet 与 B2B 渠道上（见 <a href=\"../clearance-channels/b2b-bulk-liquidation-auction\">B2B 批量清货/拍卖渠道</a>），两边会互相抢库存，导致站内清仓进度虚高（因为卖给了 B2B）或虚低（因为库存被 B2B 锁定）。正确做法是<strong>渠道配额前置</strong>：在 plan 里显式声明各渠道的可分配量，而不是让多个渠道共享同一个可售池。</p>\n<h3 id=\"曲线诊断的监控\">曲线诊断的监控</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>诊断问题</th>\n<th>观测信号</th>\n<th>处置动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阶段 2 斜率未起</td>\n<td>折扣生效但销量无提升</td>\n<td>检查曝光与流量入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶段 3 斜率仍平</td>\n<td>深折后仍无响应</td>\n<td>需求耗尽，转渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进度持续落后</td>\n<td>progress_ratio &lt; 0.8</td>\n<td>提前进下一档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进度超前</td>\n<td>progress_ratio &gt; 1.2</td>\n<td>保持档位，保护毛利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到期未回滚</td>\n<td>价格长期停在折扣档</td>\n<td>触发 auto_expire 兜底</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>stock-to-go 是清仓路径规划的状态变量：从可清库存中扣除锁定与其他渠道分配后的<strong>出清目标</strong>，而非当前库存余额。</li>\n<li>周度目标应按需求形状加权分摊，平坦分摊会在需求前倾的品类上制造虚假的&quot;落后&quot;信号。</li>\n<li>清仓曲线呈&quot;平缓—陡峭—趋零&quot;的三段以上形状；诊断 SKU 卡在哪一段，能区分&quot;价格问题&quot;与&quot;曝光问题&quot;与&quot;需求耗尽&quot;。</li>\n<li>需求是随机变量，清仓目标应落在需求分布的某个分位数上；重尾品类（爆款尾货）不应按均值规划，否则系统性低估卖完的概率。</li>\n<li>需求参数不确定时，分批出清是用时间换确定性；把所有不确定性押在最后一档是坏策略。</li>\n<li>执行上必须有版本化、可回滚、可自动到期的价格覆盖对象，并在 plan 层做渠道配额前置，避免多渠道抢同一库存池。</li>\n<li>与渠道的衔接见 <a href=\"../clearance-channels/outlet-zone-search-exposure\">站内 outlet 专区与搜索曝光</a> 与 <a href=\"../clearance-channels/b2b-bulk-liquidation-auction\">B2B 批量清货/拍卖渠道</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"stock-to-go 与清仓曲线","id":"stock-to-go-与清仓曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"stock-to-go 的定义与分解","id":"stock-to-go-的定义与分解"},{"level":3,"text":"从库存余额到清仓目标","id":"从库存余额到清仓目标"},{"level":3,"text":"剩余 stock-to-go 的动态更新","id":"剩余-stock-to-go-的动态更新"},{"level":2,"text":"清仓曲线：路径而非点位","id":"清仓曲线-路径而非点位"},{"level":3,"text":"曲线的形状由需求与折价共同决定","id":"曲线的形状由需求与折价共同决定"},{"level":3,"text":"服务水平与报童视角","id":"服务水平与报童视角"},{"level":3,"text":"需求参数不确定下的修正","id":"需求参数不确定下的修正"},{"level":2,"text":"执行层面的工程约束","id":"执行层面的工程约束"},{"level":3,"text":"价格的生效与回滚","id":"价格的生效与回滚"},{"level":3,"text":"与库存分配的耦合","id":"与库存分配的耦合"},{"level":3,"text":"曲线诊断的监控","id":"曲线诊断的监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"markdown 时机/深度/频次弹性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/markdown-decision-optimization/markdown-timing-depth-elasticity"},"next":{"title":"清仓毛利回收与品牌价格保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/markdown-decision-optimization/clearance-margin-brand-price-guard"}}